### ===== Sprint 1 : tests de l'API (IntelliJ HTTP Client) =====
### Lance l'application, puis exécute les requêtes une par une.

### 1. Inscription (F01) - sauvegarde le token automatiquement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karim Ben Ali",
  "email": "karim@test.tn",
  "phone": "22123456",
  "password": "Password1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Connexion (F02)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "karim@test.tn",
  "password": "Password1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Mon profil (F03)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Modifier mon profil (F03)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karim B.A.",
  "phone": "+21622123456"
}

### 5. Changer le mot de passe
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password1",
  "newPassword": "Password2"
}

### 6. Ajouter un véhicule (F06)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Peugeot",
  "model": "208",
  "color": "Gris",
  "seats": 4
}

### 7. Mes véhicules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Modifier un véhicule (F07) - remplace 1 par l'id du véhicule
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Peugeot",
  "model": "208",
  "color": "Noir",
  "seats": 3
}

### 9. Supprimer un véhicule (F07)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== Cas d'erreur à vérifier =====

### 10. Sans token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me

### 11. Validation -> 400 avec fieldErrors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "pas-un-email",
  "phone": "123",
  "password": "court"
}

### 12. Email déjà utilisé -> 409 (relance la requête 1)

### 13. Mauvais mot de passe -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "karim@test.tn",
  "password": "mauvais-mot-de-passe"
}

### 14. Route admin avec un utilisateur normal -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/anything
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
